  "details": "It would be really nice to be able to world hop easier with my friend group with a synchronised warp. If I could open a group warp that my friends can join, download the world together and when it's done for everyone I can warp everyone together maybe with a countdown.\n\nThis may make portals less used but there's still potential visual finesse and cosmetics as I keep imagining a classic anime style magic summoning circle for some reason.\n\nThe initializer of the group warp will be the instance owner and this will make sure the instance owner is who we want it to be and will make the \"download world before joining\" feature more used as it upsets me how it's one of my favourite features yet even I forget it exists.\n\nIt'll also reduce the time people are separated loading alone and the time people will much faster internet will wait.\n\nI got this idea when I saw a group teleportaion trap in an anime...",
